1
00:00:01,090 --> 00:00:04,870
欢迎来到主动性驱动策略的专项训练
Welcome to the drill session on the initiative drive.

2
00:00:05,230 --> 00:00:07,790
这是第11单元，策略6
This is Unit 11, Strategy 6.

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:10,170
直接切入正题
Let’s get straight into it.

4
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:12,778
主动性驱动——我们首先讨论的关于这个策略的核心问题：它何时发生？
The initiative drive—the first thing

5
00:00:12,778 --> 00:00:16,691
we spoke about with regard to this particular trade strategy—

6
00:00:16,691 --> 00:00:18,647
is when does it occur?

7
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:23,908
我们提过时间是这个策略的关键要素因为观察到的模式会因时间不同而变化取决于是现金盘开盘时还是盘中
We spoke about time being a critical component of this trade strategy,

8
00:00:23,908 --> 00:00:28,618
simply because the pattern we’re likely to observe will differ

9
00:00:28,618 --> 00:00:36,325
depending on whether it’s at the open of the cash session or midway through a trading session.

12
00:00:36,630 --> 00:00:40,970
这是小型标普500指数期货盘面。现金盘刚开盘
Here we have the E-mini S&P 500 in front of us. The cash session has just opened.

14
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,730
这是现金盘的波动区间
This is the cash rotation.

15
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:55,150
市场开盘后先小幅下探，出现重新建仓的吸纳，开始累积
We see the market open, initially testing slightly lower, finding some form of reload absorption, and beginning the accumulation process.

19
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:58,037
此时我们不知道是否有主动性驱动不知道是否有现金盘驱动——只知道市场现在开盘了
At this point, we don’t know if there’s an initiative drive,

20
00:00:58,037 --> 00:01:00,212
we don’t know if there’s a cash drive—

21
00:01:00,212 --> 00:01:02,387
all we know is the market is open right now.

23
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:07,650
所以开盘时无法从中提取有效信息
So there’s no meaningful information we can take from this as the market opens.

26
00:01:07,890 --> 00:01:12,710
现在，如我们所讨论的策略
Now, as we discussed regarding the strategy, it’s crucial to acknowledge and accept that

29
00:01:14,950 --> 00:01:19,230
当市场出现主动性时，不要逆势操作
when there’s initiative in the market, we don’t want to be fading the market.

31
00:01:19,290 --> 00:01:21,858
不要逆主动性方向交易
We don't want to go counter to the initiative.

32
00:01:21,858 --> 00:01:26,709
相反，要顺主动性方向入场
If anything, we want to get on with the initiative trade in the direction of the initiative.

34
00:01:27,190 --> 00:01:29,923
我们还提到，主动性有时来自现金盘开盘这是个很棘手的策略，入场和回调入场都难
We also said that when the initiative comes

35
00:01:29,923 --> 00:01:32,656
sometimes from the open of the cash drive,

36
00:01:32,656 --> 00:01:39,146
it's a very tricky trade strategy, not just to get on, but also to get on to the pullback.

39
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:42,090
原因在于流动性
The reason being has to do with the liquidity.

40
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:49,170
特别是在主动性驱动中，有人在寻找尽可能多的流动性
We noted that, particularly on the initiative drive, someone is looking for as much liquidity as they can find.

42
00:01:49,170 --> 00:01:54,970
流动性越少，市场单边行情越激进
The less liquidity being provided, the more aggressive the market will move in one direction.

45
00:01:56,270 --> 00:01:59,999
话说回来，这里开盘成交量很大开盘成交了约10,000合约
That being said, we can see a real chunky open here,

46
00:01:59,999 --> 00:02:04,407
quite a lot of volume transacted, a good 10,000 contracts taken at the open.

49
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:07,970
现在看到市场回落了
We can see now the market has gone back.

50
00:02:08,170 --> 00:02:10,110
我把图表快进一下
Now I'm just going to move this a little bit forward.

51
00:02:10,450 --> 00:02:13,427
在第一个回合中，突然出现一个开盘后的外部回合价格下探前一回合低点，但收于前一回合高点之上
We can see that in this first rotation,

52
00:02:13,427 --> 00:02:17,893
suddenly, we get a bit of an outside rotation as we opened,

53
00:02:17,893 --> 00:02:21,987
tested below the previous rotation, but closed above the previous rotation.

55
00:02:21,990 --> 00:02:25,470
开盘相当激进
So quite an aggressive open there.

56
00:02:25,550 --> 00:02:28,750
市场最终在5分钟回合中完成定向
The market finally resolved itself on a five-minute rotation.

58
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:35,290
突然，市场开始激进上涨 观察不平衡
Suddenly, we start to see the market go up quite aggressively. Note, of course, the imbalance.

60
00:02:35,570 --> 00:02:38,430
594×900不平衡 相当激进
An aggressive 594 by 900 imbalance.

61
00:02:38,590 --> 00:02:42,510
47×591=27,777，199×1,600=318,400

62
00:02:42,510 --> 00:02:44,750
这里不平衡正在快速扩大
So quite an aggressive imbalance taking hold here.

63
00:02:44,750 --> 00:02:46,430
若使用不平衡策略
If this was an imbalance strategy,

64
00:02:46,430 --> 00:02:48,670
我们最终会寻找下一个回合
we would ultimately look for the next rotation

65
00:02:57,050 --> 00:02:58,790
注意 进入下一个回合 不平衡依然存在
Note, into the next rotation, the imbalance does hold.

66
00:02:59,010 --> 00:03:04,353
市场回落能看到那里的不平衡非常激进买家情绪强烈的真实信号
We’ve come back; we can see that imbalance quite aggressive there,

67
00:03:04,353 --> 00:03:08,805
a real strong signal of intense sentiment from the buyers.

69
00:03:11,784 --> 00:03:15,133
主动性驱动最棘手的部分是我们往往错过初始驱动的入场
the trickiest part about an initiative drive is that

70
00:03:15,133 --> 00:03:19,598
we don’t always tend to get in on the initial drive.

71
00:03:19,600 --> 00:03:25,967
关键是耐心通过可观察因素解读初始驱动
It’s about being patient, interpreting that initial drive through factors you can observe.

73
00:03:25,967 --> 00:03:30,140
一旦确认主动性驱动 就执行策略第11单元中讨论的策略 初始驱动完全展开后 我们再详细分析
Once you’ve seen the initiative, you then employ the strategy

74
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:32,416
that we’ve discussed throughout Unit 11.

75
00:03:32,416 --> 00:03:36,589
We’ll talk about that a little more once we have

76
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:41,510
能看到市场再次回落
fully played through the initial drive. We can see the market came back down.

77
00:03:41,950 --> 00:03:45,341
之前看到大量吸纳 现在支撑有效
Again, where we saw massive absorption, that’s now held.

78
00:03:45,341 --> 00:03:50,089
市场未能下破 随后再次反弹
The market’s failed to penetrate lower, and we’ve then rallied up again.

80
00:03:50,290 --> 00:03:58,810
这正是主动性驱动的典型特征 驱动、吸纳、驱动、吸纳 循环往复
Very typical of initiative drive—it does tend to drive, absorb, drive, absorb, drive, absorb, drive, absorb.

82
00:03:58,810 --> 00:04:08,610
驱动与吸纳交替进行 下一个回合 我们再次驱动 看到更高的吸纳
of driving and absorption in the moment. Again, the next rotation, we drive again, and we’re seeing higher absorption.

85
00:04:08,610 --> 00:04:12,716
显然 这对策略至关重要
Now, obviously, this was quite crucial in terms of the strategy.

86
00:04:12,716 --> 00:04:16,075
市场展现主动性驱动后回调过程开始我们就寻找入场点
Once the market had shown us that initiative drive

87
00:04:16,075 --> 00:04:18,687
and begun the process of a pullback,

88
00:04:18,687 --> 00:04:22,046
we would then be looking for an entry point.

89
00:04:22,170 --> 00:04:28,590
我们没详细讲的是具体入场点 这是主动性驱动的难点
What we didn’t really cover were exact entry points. This is the tricky part about an initiative drive.

91
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:31,790
没有绝对精确的入场点
There's no real exact entry point.

92
00:04:31,790 --> 00:04:36,990
有多种入场方式 你要理解市场的激进本质
There's a number of ways you can get in. You understand the aggressive nature of the market.

93
00:04:36,990 --> 00:04:44,030
但问题在于，入场点并不总是依赖精确的技术区域
But the problem is that the entry point isn't always dependent on an exact technical area.

94
00:04:44,030 --> 00:04:48,870
现在，关键的是我们要寻找区间
Now, what is crucial is we want to look for regions.

97
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:53,310
这就是我们要找的，寻找最终能为我们提供入场机会的区间
So that's what we're trying to find. We're trying to find regions that ultimately could give us opportunity for entry.

100
00:04:57,050 --> 00:04:58,970
现在看当前的例子我们可以看到一个肯定会关注的区间就是这块高成交量区域，这个高成交量口袋位置
Now, looking at the example we've got currently,

101
00:04:58,970 --> 00:05:01,610
we can see that one region we'd definitely pay attention to

102
00:05:01,610 --> 00:05:04,490
is this little chunk of volume, this high-volume area or pocket positioning.

103
00:05:04,790 --> 00:05:10,930
我们看到在两个价位区间内累积了$3,600的强Delta
We saw a good strong delta of $3,600 being accumulated in that two-price region.

105
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:15,976
接着我们看到下一个累积区和口袋位置就是这里，买家明显加大力度接下$6,500的卖盘，买家吃单远超卖家卖出的量
And then we can see our next little region of accumulation and pocket positioning

106
00:05:15,976 --> 00:05:20,682
was this little spot here, where we saw a buyer really step it up,

107
00:05:20,682 --> 00:05:22,026
take $6,500 that was offered.

108
00:05:22,026 --> 00:05:27,405
We could see the buyer was lifting a lot more than what the sellers were selling.

110
00:05:27,650 --> 00:05:35,352
所以在$94和$93.75这两个价位上，我们确实看到大量主动性Delta累积
So we really could see some real aggressive delta being accumulated over these two price points of $94 and $93.75.

112
00:05:35,352 --> 00:05:43,909
因此，我们肯定会在这些价位附近寻找主动性驱动的入场点
So we would definitely be looking for an entry point into this initiative drive in and around those price points.

114
00:05:44,330 --> 00:05:46,370
好，其他可用的指标
Okay. Some other metrics you can use,

115
00:05:46,450 --> 00:05:49,553
我喜欢画一个斐波那契回撤可能从驱动低点到当前高点
I do like to get a little Fibonacci retracement up,

116
00:05:49,553 --> 00:05:52,967
maybe from the low of the drive to the current highs.

117
00:05:53,590 --> 00:05:58,610
这也很有效，有时可能会出现不平衡
That also works quite well. And then, sometimes maybe you get an imbalance,

118
00:05:58,610 --> 00:06:00,260
这会很实用然后在执行方法上应用不平衡策略来跟进主动性驱动
which can be quite handy,

119
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:02,570
and you just apply the imbalance strategy

120
00:06:02,570 --> 00:06:07,190
in terms of the execution methodology to get on board with the initiative drive.

121
00:06:08,170 --> 00:06:13,770
现在，主动性驱动下，我们显然已经进入横盘交易
Now, with this initiative drive, we can see, obviously, we have begun the process of sideways trading now.

123
00:06:14,130 --> 00:06:17,083
注意，每次回调，我们卖出563手市场又回到买价
Note, every time it comes down, we sold 563,

124
00:06:17,083 --> 00:06:19,297
and the market went back bid.

125
00:06:21,883 --> 00:06:23,729
再次回调到这个价位，成交1,020手，又回到买价
traded 1,020 lots, went back bid.

126
00:06:23,970 --> 00:06:26,470
第三次回调，成交1,200手又回到买价，所以这里确实形成一道屏障
Came down a third time, traded 1,200 lots,

127
00:06:26,470 --> 00:06:27,898
and went back bid.

128
00:06:32,150 --> 00:06:41,652
不一定是支撑，更可能是流动性，有人在寻找流动性，只是在完成建仓
not necessarily support; it is most likely just that liquidity, someone looking for the liquidity, just getting the position filled.

130
00:06:41,652 --> 00:06:48,370
就像高盛的例子，高盛会主动拉升
So, like we used an example of Goldman Sachs, Goldman Sachs will be initiating up.

132
00:06:48,570 --> 00:06:53,125
当他们找到卖家时，你会看到双向交易，这就是吸纳
When they find a seller, you will see this, that is the two-way trade, the absorption.

134
00:06:54,550 --> 00:06:57,350
找到卖家时，就会出现双向交易，如我们所见
When they find a seller, you get the two-way trade, as we can see.

135
00:06:57,350 --> 00:07:02,144
当他们再次主动出击，找到卖家时，又会出现双向交易
And when they initiate again, and when they find the seller, we get the two-way trade again.

137
00:07:05,650 --> 00:07:13,150
但让市场回落，触发94¾区间的被动单
but allowing the market to come back and hit their passive orders around this 94¾ range.

139
00:07:13,490 --> 00:07:18,190
入场点方面，这里清楚可见关键支撑线
In terms of entry point, we can very clearly see this is the line in the sand.

141
00:07:18,270 --> 00:07:26,830
此处正在被吸纳，一路向下到93½。因此，在93½到94½区间寻找做多机会
This is where it is being absorbed, anywhere down to this 93½. So, from 93½ to 94½, we are looking for long-side trades.

144
00:07:26,830 --> 00:07:32,775
观察市场回调后再次测试该区间的表现
We will see what the market does once it comes down and tests again this area.

145
00:07:32,775 --> 00:07:38,348
看到它再次回落这次注意，回调高点略高
We can see it comes down again; this time, note, failing a little bit higher.

147
00:07:38,690 --> 00:07:44,130
上次触及94¼，这次仅达到94½
Last time we managed to get down to 94¼. This time, we only managed to get to 94½.

149
00:07:44,490 --> 00:07:49,250
还要注意卖盘减少：仅34手，仅7手
Note also the lack of selling. 34 lots only, 7 lots only.

151
00:07:49,470 --> 00:07:56,710
仅12手，仅8手。换言之，空头对低位卖出兴趣越来越低
12 lots only, 8 lots only. In other words, The sellers are becoming less and less interested in selling at lower prices.

154
00:07:56,890 --> 00:07:59,250
这是一个非常重要的线索
Now, this is a very important clue.

155
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,793
这提示我们，如果还没入场可能需要更积极，甚至直接在95点附近买入
This tells us that we're going to, unfortunately,

156
00:08:01,793 --> 00:08:03,220
if we're not in already,

157
00:08:03,220 --> 00:08:07,787
we're going to have to be a little more aggressive, possibly even buy up those 95s.

159
00:08:09,010 --> 00:08:10,930
95点再次成交
95s gets traded one last time.

160
00:08:11,150 --> 00:08:16,270
注意市场突破。之前提到低点缺乏热情
Note the market takes out. Again, we spoke about the lack of enthusiasm at lows.

163
00:08:16,270 --> 00:08:24,310
注意买盘缺乏热情：0×154，0×45，0×136，0×29
Note the lack of enthusiasm is at the bar, on the buy side: 0x154, 0x45, 0x136, 0x29.

165
00:08:24,750 --> 00:08:29,410
突然活跃起来。看到1,500合约成交
Suddenly, that picks up. We can see 1,500 contracts trade.

166
00:08:29,590 --> 00:08:32,590
这是转折的信号
That’s our signal that things are about to shift.

167
00:08:32,850 --> 00:08:34,890
足迹图上得到确认
We get confirmation on the footprint.

168
00:08:35,050 --> 00:08:38,490
注意此回合Delta为+5,000
Note the delta is 5,000 positive on this rotation.

169
00:08:38,710 --> 00:08:45,050
突破95½时出现不平衡
And we also get the imbalance on that break above 95 and a half.

171
00:08:45,050 --> 00:08:49,170
这是主动性驱动延续的真正信号
That was our real signal for the continuation of the initiative.

173
00:08:49,470 --> 00:08:53,530
理想入场点应在此区间附近
We know our entry point would have been somewhere in and around here, ideally.

175
00:08:54,090 --> 00:08:58,630
不幸的是，我们不得不在稍高位入场以确保成交
Unfortunately, we had to enter a little higher to ensure we got in.

177
00:08:58,950 --> 00:09:05,650
真正信号出现在成交量激增，而市场此前兴趣不高的区域
The real signal came once volume lifted where the market was previously not too interested.

179
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:14,690
延续的线索包括95½到96½之间的不平衡
Our clues for continuation include this imbalance left here between 95 and a half and 96 and a half.

181
00:09:15,370 --> 00:09:17,470
还有成交量的明显放大
As well as, obviously, the pickup in the volume.

182
00:09:17,470 --> 00:09:20,970
看到成交量几乎是前一回合的两倍
We can see almost double the amount of volume we did in the previous rotation.

184
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:24,470
以及Delta的强劲响应
As well as a very strong delta response.

185
00:09:24,470 --> 00:09:32,830
风险管理方面，止损可直接设在主动性驱动回合下方
Now, we noted, obviously, in terms of risk, we can put our stop simply below this initiative leg.

188
00:09:32,930 --> 00:09:38,250
不应过早平仓。否则主动性驱动可能结束
We should not be unwinding this initiative. Otherwise, the initiative is likely over.

190
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:41,696
目标方面，我们寻找持仓到市场要求我们离场为止
In terms of a target, we are looking to stay on

191
00:09:41,696 --> 00:09:44,447
as long as the market tells us to stay in.

193
00:09:44,450 --> 00:09:47,309
主动性驱动的关键，如我们所强调出现在现金盘开盘时后续波动会比盘中时更激进
The key to the initiative, as we noted,

194
00:09:47,309 --> 00:09:50,168
is when it comes at the cash open,

195
00:09:50,168 --> 00:09:55,886
the secondary move is far more aggressive than if it came, say, midpoint in the session.

197
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:58,170
这是开盘驱动的起点
This is the beginning of a session: open drive.

198
00:09:58,170 --> 00:10:00,530
我们寻找激进的延伸
We are looking for a nice, aggressive extension.

199
00:10:00,610 --> 00:10:03,290
观察到不平衡持续
We can see this imbalance holding now.

200
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:06,458
注意不平衡前的吸纳
Note the absorption in front of the imbalance,

201
00:10:06,458 --> 00:10:10,093
让我们确信即将
giving us real confidence that we are about to see

202
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:15,070
前一回合出现小幅延伸
We get a little extension on that previous rotation.

203
00:10:16,010 --> 00:10:21,270
市场继续向上波动
The market now continues the process of rotating higher. Note, obviously, quite an aggressive seller

205
00:10:22,290 --> 00:10:27,410
$25.97附近出现激进卖盘，再次被吸纳
came in around $25.97. It was absorbed again.

207
00:10:27,610 --> 00:10:29,310
至关重要
So important.

208
00:10:29,510 --> 00:10:31,831
你在这里观察到的是
What you are observing here is,

209
00:10:31,831 --> 00:10:36,087
每次市场遇到卖盘
every time the market does find some sort of an offer,

210
00:10:43,053 --> 00:10:46,148
市场再次向上延伸
Market then extends again, higher to the upside.

211
00:10:39,569 --> 00:10:43,051
吸收所有可能的成交量
sucking up all the potential volume they can get.

214
00:10:46,350 --> 00:10:48,150
注意低点的深色阴影
note what happens. Really dark shading at the low.

215
00:10:48,270 --> 00:10:50,226
看到买家
We can see these buyers,

216
00:10:50,226 --> 00:10:52,965
持续抬高买价
constantly lifting those bids higher and higher

217
00:10:56,489 --> 00:10:59,229
这个过程不断持续
This process just continues on and on.

218
00:10:59,430 --> 00:11:04,447
市场继续分步上涨
We can see the market continues its stepwise move to the upside.

219
00:11:04,447 --> 00:11:08,209
检查模板时，关注延伸
When you go through your templates, note the extension.

222
00:11:08,450 --> 00:11:11,510
